Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Read ByteArray.foldl through Array.foldl

The fold lemma behind encode_repr now shows that ByteArray.foldlM runs the same loop as Array.foldlM over the array's data. Array.foldl_toList then gives the list fold. The proof is six lines shorter and holds for any monad and range.

